"}]},{"id":"P058-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n200kW, 4극, 중권의 직류 발전기가 있다. 극당 자속이\n\n0.05, 회전속도는 1200rpm이고, 전기자에는 30개의\n\n홈이 있고 각각 4개의 코일변이 있는 경우, 직류 발전기의\n\n유기 기전력V은?\n\n\n① 100         ② 120\n\n③ 200         ④ 240","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m14-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1063},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m14-e2.webp","width":678,"height":587}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n정격 5kW, 500V, 10A , 1800rpm의 타여자 발전\n\n기의 무부하 전압V은? (단, 계자전류는 60A , 계자저항\n\n4Ω, 전기자 저항 0.2Ω, 브러시에 의한 전압강하는\n\n1V이다.)\n\n\n① 501         ② 503\n\n③ 505         ④ 507","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n효율이 80, 출력이 24kW인 직류발전기의 전손실\nkW은?\n\n\n① 4           ② 5\n\n③ 6           ④ 8","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m16-q.webp","width":678,"height":517},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m16-e1.webp","width":678,"height":415}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n극수 8, 회전속도가 1200rpm인 교류 발전기와 병행운전\n\n하기 위한 극수 6의 발전기의 회전수rpm는?\n\n\n① 1300         ② 1400\n\n③ 1500         ④ 1600","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n다음은 전기자 권선법에 관련된 설명이다. 빈칸에 알맞은\n\n것은?\n\n  전기자 권선법 중 (     )를 이용하면 기전력의\n\n  파형이 좋아지고 누설 리액턴스가 감소하고, 과열을\n\n  방지할 수 있다.\n\n\n\n① 분포권        ② 단절권\n\n③ 집중권        ④ 전절권","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력