planation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n전부하 동손이 2kW, 철손이 3kW, 출력이 115kW인\n\n직류 발전기의 전부하 효율은 약 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 91.6             ② 93.1\n\n③ 94.2         ④ 95.8","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m23-e1.webp","width":696,"height":665}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n용량 1kVA, 1000/200V의 단상변압기를 단권변압기로\n\n결선하여 1000/1200V의 승압기로 사용할 때, 그 부하\n\n용량kVA 은?\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 6           ④ 8","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2024h2-e17-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e17-m24-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1217}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P058-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.10.05 국가철도공단(전철전력) (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 2